  sentences:
  - text: "Vers 19h00, en d\xE9but de soir\xE9e. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Mais \xE7a serait \xE9trange, plusieurs t\xE9moins ont \xE9t\xE9 accueilli
      par Monsieur Warner \xE0 cette heure-ci. Pourquoi aurait-il propos\xE9 le rendez-vous
      lorsque la soir\xE9e commen\xE7ait\u202F? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 94f552401d853464eba92c33f32b25fd, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Ah, j\u2019ai d\xFB confondre\u2026 "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Majordome et \xE7a se trompe dans les horaires \u2026  "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e7a68b2376e53284bb4ce3103615c962, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
